"PaperManager 把文库、文献列表和检查器放在同一个窗口。左侧选择文集或标签，中间选择文献，右侧查看和编辑详细信息。" = "Your library, paper list, and inspector share one window. Choose a collection or tag on the left, select papers in the middle, and view or edit their details on the right.";
"使用工具栏的添加按钮，通过标识符查找文献，或手动建立一条记录。已有文件可以通过“文件 → 导入文件…”导入。" = "Use Add in the toolbar to look up a paper by identifier or enter a record manually. To bring in existing files, choose File → Import Files….";
"工具栏的面板菜单分别控制文库侧栏和论文检查器。新手导览和更新说明可以随时从帮助菜单重新打开。" = "The toolbar's Panels menu controls the library sidebar and paper inspector separately. Reopen the welcome tour or release notes at any time from Help.";
"导入支持 PDF、BibTeX、RIS 和包含这些文件的文件夹。你也可以把文件拖到文献列表。" = "Import PDFs, BibTeX, RIS, or folders containing these files. You can also drag files into the paper list.";
"先查看导入预览，再确认要导入的条目。遇到已有文献时，可以选择跳过、替换或打开已有记录；批量处理时可把同一选择应用到其余冲突。" = "Review the import preview and select the records to keep before confirming. For a duplicate, skip it, replace its bibliography, or open the existing record. Apply the same choice to all duplicates when appropriate.";
"导入到当前选中的文集或标签时，新记录会加入这个目标。通过标识符添加需要网络连接；缺少可靠标识符时，可以先手动填写标题和作者。" = "New records are added to the currently selected collection or tag. Identifier lookup needs an internet connection. If no reliable identifier is available, start by entering the title and authors manually.";
"一篇文献可以同时属于多个文集和标签。把文献拖到侧栏中的文集或标签，就能添加归属；也可以在检查器的文集和标签区域调整。" = "A paper can belong to several collections and tags. Drag papers onto a sidebar collection or tag to assign them, or change their assignments in the inspector.";
"文集最多支持三级。右键文集可以新建子文集、重命名、移到顶层或删除。拖动文集可以调整同级顺序，或移到其他文集下；会形成循环或超过三级的移动无法执行。" = "Collections support up to three levels. Right-click a collection to add a child, rename it, move it to the top level, or delete it. Drag collections to reorder siblings or change their parent. Moves that create a cycle or exceed three levels are rejected.";
"父文集可选择是否包含子文集的文献。标签可以拖动排序，并通过右键菜单选择预设颜色或输入十六进制颜色。删除文集或标签会解除这些归属，保留文献记录。" = "Choose whether a parent collection includes papers from its descendants. Drag tags to reorder them; right-click a tag to choose a preset color or enter a hex color. Deleting a collection or tag removes the assignment and keeps its papers.";
"侧栏搜索可按标题、作者、来源和年份等信息查找文献。智能筛选帮助你找到未归类、缺少 PDF 或缺少标识符的记录。" = "Use sidebar search to find papers by title, author, source, year, and other metadata. Smart filters help you find unfiled records and records missing a PDF or identifier.";
"文献列表支持多选、列排序、列宽调整和列顺序调整。右键表头可以选择显示哪些列，并重置列设置。展开一篇文献，可以查看它的 PDF 和其他附件。" = "The paper list supports multiple selection, sorting, resizing, and rearranging columns. Right-click a column header to choose visible columns or reset the layout. Expand a paper to see its PDFs and other attachments.";
"在文献列表中，按回车打开 PDF，按空格快速预览。附件行也支持打开、预览和在访达中显示。默认 PDF 阅读器可在设置中更改。" = "In the paper list, press Return to open a PDF or Space for Quick Look. Attachment rows also support opening, previewing, and revealing files in Finder. Choose a default PDF reader in Settings.";
"在检查器中直接编辑标题、作者和引用字段，内容会自动保存。切换文献或退出应用会提交尚未完成自动保存的编辑。引用键根据元数据和设置中的格式更新。" = "Edit titles, authors, and citation fields directly in the inspector. Changes save automatically; switching papers or quitting submits pending edits. Citation keys update from the metadata and the format chosen in Settings.";
"DOI、ISBN 和电子预印本编号独立保存。文献类型决定常用字段；其他已有值仍可在高级字段中编辑。展开更多字段并打开高级字段，可以把常用标准字段固定到更多字段，也可以添加和固定自定义字段。" = "DOI, ISBN, and eprint identifiers are stored independently. The paper type determines the usual fields, while other existing values remain available in Advanced Fields. Expand More Fields and open Advanced Fields to pin standard fields or add and pin custom fields.";
"摘要、备注、评分、文集和标签都可以在检查器中维护。标注页可刷新已关联 PDF 中的高亮和批注，并将提取结果导出为文本。" = "Manage the abstract, notes, rating, collections, and tags in the inspector. The Annotations tab reads highlights and comments from the linked PDF, refreshes the extracted results, and exports them as text.";
"文献记录和磁盘上的文件分别管理。你可以保留文件原位置，也可以在“设置 → 通用 → 文件库”中选择统一位置，设置复制或移动规则、分组和文件布局。" = "Library records and files on disk are managed separately. Keep files in their current locations, or choose a File Library in Settings → General and configure copying or moving, grouping, and folder layout.";
"更改文件库设置用于今后的操作。要处理已有附件，使用设置中的“应用到现有文献的文件…”或文献右键菜单中的整理操作。单独重命名可以使用右键菜单中的“按规则重命名文件…”。" = "File Library changes apply to future operations. To organize existing attachments, use Apply to Existing Paper Files… in Settings or the paper's context menu. Use Rename Files by Rule… in the context menu to rename files independently.";
"标记为只读引用的 Lattice 原文件保留在原位置，避免被整理、重命名或删除操作改动。替换主 PDF 会保留原有附件记录。删除文献时是否将自有附件移到废纸篓，由设置中的选项决定。" = "Original Lattice files marked as read-only references stay in place and are protected from organization, renaming, and deletion. Replacing the primary PDF preserves existing attachment records. Settings controls whether deleting a paper moves owned attachments to the Trash.";
"选中文献后，从工具栏导出菜单或右键菜单导出 BibTeX、RIS 和详细文本。导出菜单也提供复制到剪贴板的操作。" = "Select papers and use the toolbar's Export menu or a context menu to export BibTeX, RIS, or detailed text. The Export menu also offers clipboard copies.";
"引用设置控制是否导出摘要、标签关键词、备注和自定义字段。其他非空的基本书目信息会随文献导出。引用键格式和元数据模板可以在设置中修改。" = "Citation settings control the inclusion of abstracts, keywords from tags, notes, and custom fields. Other nonempty bibliography fields are always exported. Change the citation key format and metadata templates in Settings.";
"详细文本使用当前元数据模板；包含标注时，标注内容使用标注模板。可以先在设置或检查器中的输出预览里检查结果。" = "Detailed text uses the selected metadata template. When annotations are included, each annotation uses the separate annotation template. Check the output preview in Settings or the inspector before exporting.";
"在“设置 → 模板”中选择、新建、复制、重命名或删除元数据模板。正文中的变量和条件块按文献内容渲染；恢复默认只重置当前正文，标注模板单独维护。" = "Select, create, duplicate, rename, or delete metadata templates in Settings → Templates. Variables and conditional blocks are rendered from each paper. Restore Default resets only the selected template's body; the annotation template is edited separately.";
"在设置的备份页面导出 .papermanager 文库备份。启用“包含已链接的 PDF 和附件”后，备份会携带可访问的文件，便于迁移到其他位置。" = "Export a .papermanager library backup from Settings → Backup. Enable Include Linked PDFs and Attachments to package accessible files with the library for transfer to another location.";
"恢复备份会替换当前文库。请先检查目标文库并保留需要的数据，再选择备份文件恢复。文件无法访问时，查看操作结果中的提示。" = "Restoring a backup replaces the current library. Check the target library and keep any data you need before choosing a backup. Read the operation's messages if a linked file cannot be accessed.";
"Lattice 备份使用专门的恢复入口；从 Lattice 读取元数据和恢复完整备份是两个不同操作。仅保存元数据的旧备份仍依赖其记录中的文件位置。" = "Use the dedicated restore action for Lattice backups. Reading metadata from Lattice and restoring a complete archive are separate operations. Older metadata-only backups still depend on their recorded file locations.";
"从 Zotero 导入时，选择包含 zotero.sqlite 的数据文件夹，先读取并检查迁移预览。默认只导入元数据；复制 PDF 和外部链接文件分别需要明确选择，Zotero 原文件不会被移动或删除。" = "For Zotero migration, choose the data folder containing zotero.sqlite, then read and review the migration preview. Metadata-only import is the default. Copying PDFs and including external linked files require separate choices; Zotero source files are never moved or deleted.";
"在“设置 → 集成”的本地 API 页面启用服务后，本地连接器和命令行可以查询文库、读取文献和提交导入。页面会显示当前监听地址和运行状态。" = "Enable the Local API in Settings → Integrations to let local connectors and command-line tools query the library, read papers, and submit imports. The page shows the listening address and service status.";
"只读模式适合只查询文献的工具。需要添加或更新记录时，先关闭只读模式；不使用集成时可以关闭服务。" = "Use read-only mode for tools that only need to query papers. Turn it off before adding or updating records, and disable the service when you do not need integrations.";
"浏览器和命令行添加的文件与本地导入共用已配置的文件库规则。API 操作结果会提示重复记录、未匹配的文集和文件处理情况。" = "Files added by browsers and command-line tools use the configured File Library rules. API results report duplicates, unmatched collections, and file handling outcomes.";
"快捷指令中的“导出文献元数据”可选择文献和模板，并返回文本或复制到剪贴板。不指定模板时使用当前模板；标注内容由独立的包含标注选项控制。" = "In Shortcuts, Export Paper Metadata lets you select papers and a template, then return text or copy it to the clipboard. Omitting a template uses the current selection. A separate Include Annotations option controls annotation content.";
"文件和文库菜单的操作应用到当前活动的文库窗口。你可以打开多个窗口，在不同文集或搜索结果间工作。" = "File and Library menu commands apply to the active library window. Open multiple windows to work with different collections or search results.";
"回车、空格和删除键的文献操作在列表获得焦点时生效；在文本字段中，这些按键用于正常编辑。面板显示状态可以从工具栏面板菜单或显示菜单调整。" = "Return, Space, and Delete act on papers while the list has focus; in text fields, they retain their normal editing behavior. Change panel visibility from the toolbar's Panels menu or the View menu.";
