"也支持 arXiv ID、ISBN 或标题" = "Also supports arXiv IDs, ISBNs, or titles";
"查找" = "Find";
"复制版本信息" = "Copy Version Information";
"快速开始" = "Quick Start";
"PaperManager 是一款 macOS 原生的文献管理工具。" = "PaperManager is a native macOS reference manager.";
"第一步：导入文献" = "Step 1: Import Papers";
"PaperManager 支持多种导入方式，让你快速建立文献库：" = "Build your library using any of these import methods:";
"点击工具栏中的 + 并选择“导入文件…”，即可选择 PDF、BibTeX、RIS 文件或文件夹" = "Click + in the toolbar and choose Import Files… to select PDFs, BibTeX, RIS, or folders.";
"拖拽 PDF 文件或文件夹到文献列表" = "Drag PDFs or folders into the paper list.";
"通过 DOI、arXiv、ISBN 或标题查找文献" = "Look up papers by DOI, arXiv ID, ISBN, or title.";
"确认导入前，可以预览条目并决定如何处理重复文献。自动补全元数据可在设置中调整。" = "Preview the items and decide how to handle duplicates before importing. Adjust automatic metadata enrichment in Settings.";
"了解更多导入方式" = "More Ways to Import";
"可以在设置 → 备份中选择从 Zotero 迁移现有文献库。" = "Migrate an existing Zotero library from Settings → Backup.";
"第二步：浏览与整理" = "Step 2: Browse and Organize";
"使用文集、标签和评分来整理你的文献库：" = "Organize your library with collections, tags, and ratings:";
"创建文集，将相关文献归类到不同项目或主题" = "Create collections to group papers by project or topic.";
"为文献添加标签，支持自定义颜色" = "Add tags with custom colors.";
"使用星级评分标记重要文献" = "Use star ratings to mark important papers.";
"右键侧栏的“文集”或“标签”标题，即可新建文集或标签。" = "Right-click the Collections or Tags heading in the sidebar to create one.";
"第三步：导出引用" = "Step 3: Export References";
"选中文献后，可以导出 BibTeX、RIS，或使用模板生成包含笔记和标注的详细文本。" = "Select papers to export BibTeX or RIS, or generate detailed text with notes and annotations using a template.";
"了解更多导出选项" = "More Export Options";
"在文献列表中按回车打开 PDF，按空格快速预览。" = "Press Return in the paper list to open a PDF, or Space to preview it.";
"从 PDF、BibTeX、RIS 文件或文件夹中将文献添加到 PaperManager 文献库。" = "Add papers to PaperManager from PDFs, BibTeX, RIS, or folders.";
"点击工具栏 + 按钮并选择“导入文件…”，或按 ⌘I 打开文件选择器" = "Click + in the toolbar and choose Import Files…, or press ⌘I.";
"可以选择多个文件；文件夹中的可支持文件会展开为同一批次" = "Select multiple files or folders. Supported files in folders are combined into one batch.";
"将 PDF 文件或文件夹直接拖到文献列表，也可以开始导入" = "You can also start an import by dragging PDFs or folders into the paper list.";
"在预览中逐条勾选，检查标题、作者和来源，再确认导入" = "Select items in the preview, review their title, authors, and source, then import.";
"检测到重复文献时，可以选择跳过、替换或打开已有记录，也可以把同一决策应用到其余冲突" = "For duplicates, choose Skip, Replace, or Open Existing. You can apply the same choice to remaining conflicts.";
"后台补全元数据使用“通用 → 更多选项 → 自动处理”中的设置；需要重新获取时，可选中文献后右键刷新元数据。" = "Automatic enrichment follows General → More Options → Automatic Processing. To fetch metadata again, select papers and choose Refresh Metadata from the context menu.";
"选择“文件 → 通过标识符添加…”，或按 ⇧⌘D" = "Choose File → Add by Identifier…, or press ⇧⌘D.";
"输入 DOI、arXiv 编号、ISBN 或标题，检索需要网络连接" = "Enter a DOI, arXiv ID, ISBN, or title. Lookups require a network connection.";
"在导入前检查候选信息和重复记录；缺少可靠标识符时也可手动添加" = "Review candidates and duplicates before importing. You can add a paper manually when no reliable identifier is available.";
"导入时自动归类" = "Assigning Imported Papers";
"当侧栏选中了某个文集或标签时，新导入的文献会加入这个目标。选择智能筛选时不会自动添加文集或标签。" = "New papers join the collection or tag selected in the sidebar. Smart filters do not add collection or tag assignments.";
"批量导入到特定文集时，先在侧栏选中目标文集，再执行导入。" = "Select the destination collection in the sidebar before importing a batch.";
"了解文集与标签管理" = "Managing Collections and Tags";
"文献管理" = "Library Management";
"在侧栏创建、重命名或删除顶层文集" = "Create, rename, or delete top-level collections in the sidebar.";
"使用“新建子文集”创建嵌套文集，整个层级最多三级" = "Choose New Subcollection to nest collections up to three levels deep.";
"拖拽文集可调整同级顺序；拖到另一个文集上可以设为子文集" = "Drag collections to reorder siblings or drop onto another collection to nest them.";
"父文集可切换是否包含子文集中的文献" = "Choose whether parent collections include papers in their subcollections.";
"拖拽文献到文集进行分配，一篇文献可以属于多个文集" = "Drag papers onto a collection to assign them. A paper can belong to several collections.";
"“未归类”智能筛选显示不属于任何文集的文献" = "The Unfiled filter shows papers that do not belong to any collection.";
"在侧栏创建、重命名或删除标签" = "Create, rename, or delete tags in the sidebar.";
"标签可拖拽排序，右键可选择颜色或输入十六进制颜色" = "Drag tags to reorder them. Right-click to choose a color or enter a hexadecimal color.";
"把文献拖到标签进行分配，一篇文献可以有多个标签" = "Drag papers onto a tag to assign it. A paper can have several tags.";
"在检查器或文献列表中设置 1～5 星评分" = "Set a rating of 1–5 stars in the inspector or paper list.";
"再次点击当前星级可以清除评分" = "Click the current star rating again to clear it.";
"智能筛选" = "Smart Filters";
"筛选" = "Filter";
"说明" = "Description";
"整个文库" = "The entire library";
"不在任何文集中的文献" = "Papers without a collection";
"没有主 PDF 的文献" = "Papers without a primary PDF";
"缺少 DOI、ISBN 和预印本编号的文献" = "Papers without a DOI, ISBN, or preprint identifier";
"标注与元数据" = "Annotations and Metadata";
"检查器中点击编辑按钮即可编辑标题、作者和引用字段；编辑会自动保存" = "Click Edit in the inspector to edit titles, authors, and citation fields. Changes save automatically.";
"作者使用分号分隔，文献类型决定常用引用字段" = "Separate authors with semicolons. The paper type determines its main citation fields.";
"更多字段和高级字段支持固定字段、自定义字段" = "More Fields and Advanced Fields support pinned and custom fields.";
"标注页可刷新 PDF 中的高亮、批注和图形标注，并导出提取结果" = "The Annotations tab can refresh PDF highlights, comments, and shape annotations, and export the results.";
"元数据刷新和文件整理在后台执行。进度区可以取消操作；已经完成的项目会保留。" = "Metadata refresh and file organization run in the background. Cancel from the progress area; completed items are kept.";
"在“设置 → 通用”中选择并授权文件库。它是整理文件、浏览器保存、Zotero 复制及恢复流程使用的统一位置。" = "Choose and authorize a File Library in Settings → General. Managed files, browser saves, Zotero copies, and restores share this location.";
"更改文件夹只影响今后的文件操作，已有文件保留原位置" = "Changing the folder affects future operations; existing files stay in place.";
"放入文件库的文件不会自动导入文献库" = "Files placed in the File Library are not imported automatically.";
"也可以选择“将本地文件保留在原位置”，继续链接原文件" = "Choose Keep Local Files in Place to continue linking the original files.";
"不做任何处理：保留原文件位置并建立链接" = "Do Nothing: keep files in place and link to them.";
"复制：将文件复制到文件库，保留来源文件" = "Copy: copy files into the File Library and preserve their source.";
"移动：将文件移到文件库；移动或复制前的确认可在更多选项中调整" = "Move: move files into the File Library. Change confirmation preferences in More Options.";
"已配置文件库时，浏览器保存、Zotero 复制和显式整理可以使用它，即使本地文件操作设为“不做任何处理”。" = "A configured File Library can be used for browser saves, Zotero copies, and explicit organization even when the local file action is Do Nothing.";
"文件布局与分组" = "File Layout and Grouping";
"分开：主 PDF 和其他附件分别管理" = "Separate: manage primary PDFs separately from other attachments.";
"按文献：将每篇文献的主 PDF 与附件放在一个文件夹中" = "By Paper: keep each paper's primary PDF and attachments in one folder.";
"可按年份、第一作者姓氏首字母或文集路径分组" = "Group files by year, first author's initial, or collection path.";
"设置中的“应用到现有文献的文件…”会启动后台整理，可以查看进度并取消" = "Apply to Existing Paper Files… starts background organization with progress and cancellation.";
"重命名规则" = "Renaming Rules";
"自动重命名使用设置中的格式。文献右键菜单还提供单独的按规则重命名和整理文件操作。" = "Automatic renaming uses the format in Settings. The paper context menu also provides separate Rename and Organize actions.";
"附件与删除" = "Attachments and Deletion";
"展开文献可查看附件，右键可以打开、快速预览、在访达中显示或移除关联" = "Expand a paper to view attachments. Right-click to open, preview, reveal in Finder, or remove a link.";
"删除文献时是否将自有附件移入废纸篓，由通用设置中的开关决定" = "The General preference controls whether deleting a paper moves its owned attachments to Trash.";
"只读引用的 Lattice 来源文件保留原位置，整理、重命名和删除不会修改它们" = "Read-only Lattice source files stay in place and are not changed by organization, renaming, or deletion.";
"引用相关" = "Citations";
"Citekey 格式" = "Citekey Format";
"在“设置 → 引用”中配置引用键格式，并查看实时示例。" = "Configure your citekey format and see a live example in Settings → Citations.";
"变量" = "Variable";
"示例" = "Example";
"第一作者姓氏（小写）" = "First author's surname, lowercase";
"第一作者姓氏（首字母大写）" = "First author's surname, capitalized";
"完整发表年份" = "Full publication year";
"两位年份" = "Two-digit year";
"标题第一个有意义的词" = "First meaningful title word";
"文献的引用键用于显示、复制、搜索和导出" = "A paper's citekey is used for display, copying, searching, and exporting.";
"修改格式或相关标题、作者、年份后，引用键会随之更新" = "Citekeys update when the format or relevant title, author, or year changes.";
"重复引用键会添加后缀，保持文库内唯一" = "Duplicate citekeys receive a suffix to keep them unique in the library.";
"四个独立复选框控制 BibTeX 和 RIS 是否包含摘要、标签关键词、备注和自定义字段。其他所有非空字段始终导出。" = "Four checkboxes control whether BibTeX and RIS include abstracts, tag keywords, notes, and custom fields. Other nonempty fields are always exported.";
"导出字段开关只影响导出内容，不会删除或修改文献的元数据。" = "Export field preferences affect exports only; they do not delete or modify paper metadata.";
"导出数据" = "Export Data";
"选中文献后，通过工具栏的导出按钮或按 ⌘E 保存 .bib 文件。导出菜单也提供 RIS 和复制到剪贴板。" = "Select papers and use Export in the toolbar, or press ⌘E, to save a .bib file. The menu also offers RIS and clipboard copying.";
"引用键使用文献当前维护的值" = "Exports use the paper's current maintained citekey.";
"BibTeX 和 RIS 共用“设置 → 引用”中的四项导出字段开关" = "BibTeX and RIS share the four export field preferences in Settings → Citations.";
"文献右键菜单可以直接复制 BibTeX、RIS 或详细文本" = "The paper context menu can copy BibTeX, RIS, or detailed text directly.";
"只想快速粘贴引用时，选中一篇或多篇文献，使用右键菜单中的复制操作。" = "To paste references quickly, select one or more papers and use a Copy action from the context menu.";
"详细导出" = "Detailed Export";
"在工具栏导出菜单中选择“详细导出…”，再选择输出文件夹。每篇文献生成独立文件。" = "Choose Detailed Export… in the toolbar's Export menu, then choose a folder. Each paper gets its own file.";
"没有标注图片时生成 .md 文件；有标注图片时生成 .textbundle" = "Papers without annotation images produce .md files; papers with images produce .textbundle files.";
"内容由当前元数据模板和标注模板共同渲染" = "Content is rendered with the current metadata and annotation templates.";
"文件名使用引用键，重名时自动追加编号" = "Filenames use citekeys, adding a number when needed to avoid collisions.";
"遇到不可访问的标注图片等问题，会报告具体原因" = "Errors such as inaccessible annotation images are reported with a specific reason.";
"模板设置" = "Template Settings";
"概述" = "Overview";
"模板用于详细导出和检查器中的输出预览" = "Templates are used for detailed exports and the inspector's output preview.";
"两套独立正文：整篇文献的元数据模板，以及每条标注的标注模板" = "There are two independent templates: metadata for each paper and annotations for each annotation.";
"在“设置 → 模板”中编辑，右上角按钮恢复默认正文" = "Edit them in Settings → Templates. The top-right button restores the default content.";
"展开“模板管理与预览”可选择、新建、复制、重命名或删除元数据模板" = "Expand Manage Templates and Preview to select, create, duplicate, rename, or delete metadata templates.";
"语法" = "Syntax";
"输出字段值，空字段输出空字符串" = "Output a field's value, or an empty string if the field is empty.";
"仅在 field 非空时输出块内内容，支持嵌套" = "Render the block only when field is nonempty. Blocks can be nested.";
"例如，仅在存在摘要时输出 Abstract 标题和正文：" = "For example, output the Abstract heading and content only when an abstract exists:";
"元数据模板变量" = "Metadata Template Variables";
"文献标题" = "Paper title";
"作者列表" = "Author list";
"发表年份" = "Publication year";
"期刊/来源" = "Journal or source";
"摘要 / 备注" = "Abstract / Notes";
"文集名称" = "Collection names";
"完整层级文集路径" = "Full collection paths";
"标签名称" = "Tag names";
"指向当前文献的 PaperManager 链接" = "PaperManager link to the current paper";
"主 PDF 文件链接" = "Primary PDF file link";
"标注模板渲染的内容" = "Content rendered by the annotation template";
"层级文集路径使用 {{collectionPaths}}，保留旧模板变量 {{latticeURL}} 会生成 papermanager://paper/ 链接。" = "Use {{collectionPaths}} for collection hierarchies. The legacy {{latticeURL}} variable produces a papermanager://paper/ link.";
"标注模板变量" = "Annotation Template Variables";
"标注类型" = "Annotation type";
"页码 / 页标签" = "Page number / Page label";
"选中文本" = "Selected text";
"用户批注" = "User comment";
"标注颜色" = "Annotation color";
"标注图片路径" = "Annotation image path";
"PaperManager 把文献元数据、标注、标签和文集保存在本地文库。备份导出为 .papermanager 归档，可用于迁移或恢复。" = "PaperManager stores paper metadata, annotations, tags, and collections in a local library. Export a .papermanager backup for migration or recovery.";
"创建备份" = "Create a Backup";
"前往“设置 → 备份”，点击“备份”并选择保存位置。开启“包含已链接的 PDF 和附件”时，归档会包含可访问文件的副本。" = "Go to Settings → Backup, click Backup, and choose a destination. Include Linked PDFs and Attachments to archive copies of accessible files.";
"不包含附件时，备份只保存文库数据，已有文件仍依赖原位置。" = "Without attachments, the backup contains library data only and still relies on the files' original locations.";
"从备份恢复" = "Restore a Backup";
"点击“恢复”并选择备份。确认后，归档内容会替换当前文库；恢复前会保留一份当前文库的安全副本。" = "Click Restore and choose a backup. After confirmation it replaces the current library, which is first saved as a safety copy.";
"“更多备份选项与文库信息”还提供专门的 Lattice 备份恢复入口，以及当前文库数量和文件位置。" = "More Backup Options and Library Information provides Lattice backup restore, library counts, and the library file location.";
"选择包含 zotero.sqlite 的数据文件夹，先读取并检查文献、文集、笔记和标注的迁移预览。" = "Choose the data folder containing zotero.sqlite, then read and review the migration preview for papers, collections, notes, and annotations.";
"默认只迁移元数据；复制 PDF 和外部链接文件需要分别选择" = "By default, only metadata is migrated. PDF and externally linked file copying are separate choices.";
"复制 PDF 使用已授权的 PaperManager 文件库" = "PDF copies use the authorized PaperManager File Library.";
"源 Zotero 数据和 PDF 保留原位置，不会被移动或删除" = "The source Zotero data and PDFs stay in place and are never moved or deleted.";
"文件库不可访问或存在旧路径冲突时，先在通用设置中处理" = "Resolve unavailable folders or legacy path conflicts in General settings first.";
"快捷指令" = "Shortcuts";
"“导出文献元数据”需要使用完整 Apple 工具链生成快捷指令元数据后，才能由系统发现。当前安装版尚未验证系统发现；若快捷指令中没有此操作，请使用下方的脚本或链接方式。" = "Export Paper Metadata requires Shortcuts metadata generated by the full Apple toolchain for system discovery. Discovery has not been verified in this installed build. If the action is absent in Shortcuts, use the script or URL workflows below.";
"输出模式可以返回文本，或复制到剪贴板；默认为复制到剪贴板" = "Output can return text or copy it to the clipboard. Copy to Clipboard is the default.";
"包含标注选项控制是否附带标注正文，图片标注使用文字占位符" = "Include Annotations controls whether annotation content is included. Images use text placeholders.";
"未选择模板时使用当前元数据模板，原文献和模板不会被修改" = "If no template is selected, the current metadata template is used. Papers and templates are not modified.";
"可以把返回的文本传给下一步操作，组合成自己的研究笔记流程。" = "Pass the returned text to the next action to build your own research note workflow.";
"脚本与链接" = "Scripts and URLs";
"也可以组合“运行 Shell 脚本”和“打开 URL”，调用本地命令行或定位已有文献。" = "Combine Run Shell Script and Open URL to call the local CLI or locate an existing paper.";
"查询文献元数据" = "Query Paper Metadata";
"保持 PaperManager 运行并开启本地 API，再在 Shell 脚本中调用应用内的命令行工具。下面的查询不会修改文库。" = "Keep PaperManager running with the Local API enabled, then call its bundled CLI from a shell script. The query below does not modify the library.";
"结果是 JSON，可以传给后续快捷指令操作。使用 get-paper --id <UUID> 获取文献详情；使用 get-csl-item --reference <UUID或引用键> 获取 CSL 元数据。" = "The JSON result can be passed to later actions. Use get-paper --id <UUID> for paper details or get-csl-item --reference <UUID-or-citekey> for CSL metadata.";
"客户端端口需要与“设置 → 集成”一致。使用非默认端口时，添加 --port 参数。" = "Match the port in Settings → Integrations. Add --port when using a non-default port.";
"打开已有文献" = "Open an Existing Paper";
"papermanager://paper/<文献 UUID>" = "papermanager://paper/<paper UUID>";
"在“打开 URL”中传入文库中已有文献的 UUID，即可在 PaperManager 中选中它。元数据模板的 {{latticeURL}} 变量也会生成这种链接。" = "Pass an existing paper's UUID to Open URL to select it in PaperManager. The {{latticeURL}} metadata variable produces this link too.";
"查看本地 API" = "View Local API";
"PaperManager 提供本机 HTTP 接口，供脚本、命令行、MCP 和浏览器连接器查询文献及提交导入。" = "PaperManager provides a local HTTP interface for scripts, the CLI, MCP, and browser connectors to query papers and submit imports.";
"在“设置 → 集成 → 本地 API”中启用或关闭服务" = "Enable or disable the service in Settings → Integrations → Local API.";
"监听地址为 127.0.0.1，端口以设置中的当前值为准" = "The service listens on 127.0.0.1 using the port configured in Settings.";
"API 端点位于 /api/v1 下，返回 JSON" = "API endpoints are under /api/v1 and return JSON.";
"只读模式会禁止写入请求；查询文献不需要关闭只读模式" = "Read-only mode blocks writes. You can query papers without disabling it.";
"打开浏览器扩展帮助" = "Open Browser Extension Help";
"基础地址" = "Base URL";
"修改端口后，同时更新外部客户端或浏览器连接器的配置。" = "After changing the port, update external clients and the browser connector too.";
"端点列表" = "Endpoints";
"路径" = "Path";
"版本、功能和文件库状态" = "Versions, capabilities, and File Library status";
"文献详情和 CSL 元数据" = "Paper details and CSL metadata";
"按引用键查询文献" = "Find papers by citekey";
"文集列表" = "Collection list";
"标签列表" = "Tag list";
"创建文献，需允许写入" = "Create a paper; writes must be allowed";
"附加 PDF，需允许写入并有可用文件库" = "Attach a PDF; requires writes and an available File Library";
"在“设置 → 集成”中打开 MCP 配置说明，或导出 Agent Skill。导出的连接配置使用当前端口，并默认只读。" = "Open MCP instructions or export an Agent Skill in Settings → Integrations. Exported configurations use the current port and default to read-only.";
"浏览器扩展" = "Browser Extension";
"PaperManager Connector 可读取当前网页的引用元数据，预览和编辑后保存到文库。先开启本地 API，并在连接器中使用相同端口。" = "PaperManager Connector reads citation metadata from the current page, then previews it for editing and saving. Enable the Local API and use the same port in the connector.";
"通过“设置 → 集成 → 更多集成选项 → 显示浏览器扩展…”找到随应用提供的扩展源码" = "Find the bundled extension source in Settings → Integrations → More Integration Options → Show Browser Extension…";
"在开发者控制的 Chrome 或 Edge 中手动加载该文件夹；应用不会自动安装或授权扩展" = "Load the folder manually in a developer-controlled Chrome or Edge profile. The app does not install or authorize extensions automatically.";
"保存前可以编辑元数据，并选择多个文集和标签" = "Edit metadata and choose multiple collections and tags before saving.";
"重复文献默认跳过；替换元数据和替换主 PDF 是独立选择" = "Duplicates default to Skip. Replacing metadata and replacing the primary PDF are separate choices.";
"上传 PDF 为可选操作；跨站 PDF 可先下载，再选择本地文件" = "PDF upload is optional. Download cross-origin PDFs first, then select the local file.";
"文件库不可用时可只保存元数据；旧路径冲突需要先在通用设置中解决" = "Save metadata only when the File Library is unavailable. Resolve legacy path conflicts in General settings first.";
"只读模式会阻止创建文献和上传 PDF" = "Read-only mode blocks paper creation and PDF uploads.";
"扩展使用当前标签页授权。修改端口后，请同步修改连接器配置；不要把源代码文件夹当作已经启用的 Safari 扩展。" = "The extension uses the current tab's permission. Update the connector after changing ports. A source folder is not an enabled Safari extension.";
